### Get all entities data (up to 10 rows)

GET http://localhost:5000/tasks/1
Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8

### Get all entities data (from middle of table)

GET http://localhost:5000/tasks/2
Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8

### Get data for several specific attributes

GET http://localhost:5000/tasks/3
Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8

### Delete orders by codes [ORD-1002,ORD-1003]

GET http://localhost:5000/tasks/4
Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8

### Reset customers password if not set

GET http://localhost:5000/tasks/5
Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8
